        "Description": "Happy Friday the 13th, agent! This is the second month in a row, isn&apos;t that something? And how can we get more scary than the straw-made costume to scare off the crows?\r\rTo fulfill that fear, we&apos;re in the Southwestern United States in Colorado, where we can blend in to the rural surroundings. Two targets need blowing (up) and two need sniper, the last, ehh, whatever you think best.\r\rGood luck, and hopefully you don&apos;t get too spooked.",
